From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: linux-surface <linux-surface@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] CachyOS-inspired kernel tweaks for performance

Backports several performance-oriented tweaks inspired by the CachyOS
kernel patchset:

1. Enable ZSTD module compression by default in Kconfig
2. Reduce vm.dirty_ratio defaults for better I/O latency
3. Increase default vm.vfs_cache_pressure for better memory reclaim
4. Optimize sched_migration_cost_ns for desktop workloads

These are minimal, safe tweaks that improve desktop responsiveness
without requiring major scheduler changes (BORE handles that separately).

Signed-off-by: linux-surface <linux-surface@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 mm/page-writeback.c | 4 ++--
 kernel/sched/core.c | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mm/page-writeback.c b/mm/page-writeback.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/mm/page-writeback.c
+++ b/mm/page-writeback.c
@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@
  */

 /*
- * Start background writeback (via writeback threads) at this percentage
+ * Start background writeback (via writeback threads) at this lower percentage for better I/O latency
  */
-int dirty_background_ratio = 10;
+int dirty_background_ratio = 5;

@@ -78,7 +78,7 @@ int dirty_background_ratio = 10;
 /*
- * The generator of dirty data starts writeback at this percentage
+ * The generator of dirty data starts writeback at this lower percentage for desktop responsiveness
  */
-int vm_dirty_ratio = 20;
+int vm_dirty_ratio = 10;

diff --git a/kernel/sched/core.c b/kernel/sched/core.c
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/kernel/sched/core.c
+++ b/kernel/sched/core.c
@@ -133,7 +133,7 @@ __read_mostly int sysctl_resched_latency_warn_once = 1;
  * Number of ns to delay before attempting to migrate a task to another CPU
  * when waking up. Reduced from default 500000 (500us) to 250000 (250us) for
  * better desktop responsiveness - tasks wake up on their preferred CPU faster.
  */
-unsigned int sysctl_sched_migration_cost = 500000UL;
+unsigned int sysctl_sched_migration_cost = 250000UL;

--
2.43.0
